            "review_title": "Review at Chef' Table Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Peter Grant\n1 contribution\n0\nI would be a regular if I lived there.\nAug 2025 • Friends\nI was in BMT for only 4 nights, we went to Chefs Table for lunch on one of those days. It was so nice, I suggested we go back a second time. If I lived there, I would almost certainly become a regular, the food was great, the beer cold, the service great. \nIt is in my opinion is a very well-run restaurant. \nOne thing I am fastidious about is the cleanliness of any bathroom that I use, this was top notch. It is my opinion clean restroom, clean kitchen and everything else.\nAwesome with Great prices.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nI tried the Seabass on the first visit, on the second I chose the Steak with Mash both very nicely presented and cooked perfecto.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 20, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
