            "review_text": "Adriana Chiari\nArona, Italy77 contributions\n0\nTop cuisine. High level\nOct 2023 • Friends\nHaute international cuisine. Excellent Italian wine. Presentation of haute cuisine dishes. We enjoyed pumpkin soup, clam chowder, duck breast, beefsteak, mussels, fruit salad. All of a high standard and with refined presentation. Excellent red wine from an Italian company from Salento, also esteemed in Italy. Only one flaw. On the drinks menu I would put a craft beer and a SanPellegrino or Perrier mineral water. Unfortunately only Tiger beer, which is not up to par with the fine dishes.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten October 20, 2023",
